# Project Guidelines

## MCP Tool usage
- **Always use EDS MCP Server** for creation of new EDS block and EDS Block variation.

## Rule for get_figma_data MCP tool usage

- Once design data is fetched from get_figma_data MCP tool, first analyse global styles under /styles directory and make any updates to global styles first.
- Once updates are made to global styles make changes as per user requirement.